				  <!--BEGIN ABSTRACT//--><H2>TR-79<BR>Dulcin (CAS: 150-69-6)</H2></p><p>	Data from this study considered to be inconclusive and not reportable; noTechnical Report issued.</p><HR><!--END ABSTRACT//--><p><A HREF="/index.cfm?objectid=084801F0-F43F-7B74-0BE549908B5E5C1C" >Return to Long Term Abstracts</A></p><p><!-- Last reviewed for compliance 24 May 2001 -->
